<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 3,259 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 2,659 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  171   (143 and 185)</p>
<p>    Good		125   (122 and 140)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     117   (115 and 120)</p>
<p>    Medium	    107   (105 and 104)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 90   ( 88 and  90)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 171 pence for a Burundi PF.</p>
</text>
